{"sections":{"accordion_H9Gq9m":{"type":"accordion","blocks":{"accor_item_XyeyE9":{"type":"accor_item","settings":{"icon":"none","title":"Welche Länder beliefert ihr?","content":"<p>Aktuell liefern wir innerhalb Deutschlands. Internationale Bestellungen sind in Planung!<\/p>"}},"accor_item_jBqCKa":{"type":"accor_item","settings":{"icon":"none","title":"Wie lange dauert der Versand?","content":"<p>Wir liefern deine Bestellung innerhalb von 2–5 Werktagen. Du erhältst eine Tracking-Nummer, um deine Lieferung zu verfolgen.<\/p>"}},"accor_item_Mhg3Je":{"type":"accor_item","settings":{"icon":"none","title":"Kann ich meine Bestellung verfolgen?","content":"<p>Ja, sobald deine Bestellung verschickt wurde, erhältst du eine E-Mail mit deiner Tracking-Nummer.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["accor_item_XyeyE9","accor_item_jBqCKa","accor_item_Mhg3Je"],"custom_css":[".t4s-title {font-size: 24px !important;}"],"settings":{"design_heading":"16","heading_align":"t4s-text-center","top_heading":"Bestellung & Versand","icon_heading":"las la-gem","top_subheading":"","tophead_mb":30,"accor_des":"1","title_cl":"#723a2b","bg_title_cl":"#f6f6f8","title_active_cl":"#ffffff","bg_title_active_cl":"#16b9da","content_cl":"#723a2b","bg_content_cl":"#ffffff","content_align":"t4s-text-start","auto_active":false,"layout":"t4s-container-wrap","custom_width":1000,"cl_bg":"","cl_bg_gradient":"","mg":"80px","pd":"","mg_tb":"80px","pd_tb":"","mg_mb":"60px","pd_mb":"","use_cus_css":false,"code_cus_css":""}},"accordion_CCArtQ":{"type":"accordion","blocks":{"accor_item_xQyPnX":{"type":"accor_item","settings":{"icon":"none","title":"Woher stammen die Produkte?","content":"<p>Unsere Snacks kommen aus über 20 Ländern, darunter Japan, USA, Dubai und viele mehr!<\/p>"}},"accor_item_Ptxdzk":{"type":"accor_item","settings":{"icon":"none","title":"Sind die Snacks original und frisch?","content":"<p>Ja, alle Snacks stammen direkt aus ihren Herkunftsländern und werden frisch und originalverpackt geliefert.<\/p>"}},"accor_it